{
  "info": {
    "name": "Huly TPI",
    "_postman_id": "huly-tpi-collection",
    "description": "Colección general del proyecto Huly TPI.\n\nVariable de entorno:\n- baseUrl: ajustar según el puerto definido en application-huly-secrets.properties (por defecto: http://localhost:8080)\n\nSeveridades de riesgo: LOW | MEDIUM | HIGH",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "URL base del backend. Cambiar según entorno (dev/qa/prod)."
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT de acceso. Se guarda automáticamente al hacer login."
    },
    {
      "key": "riskWordId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ID de palabra de riesgo. Actualizar después de crear una."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Flujo de autenticación: registro, login, renovación de token y logout.\n\nEl refresh token se maneja como cookie HTTP-only (el navegador/Postman lo gestiona automáticamente).\nEl access token se guarda en la variable `accessToken` al hacer login y se usa como Bearer token en los demás requests.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Juan\",\n  \"email\": \"usuario@huly.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Registra un nuevo usuario con rol USER y estado ACTIVE.\n\n**Respuesta exitosa:** 201 Created\n**Errores posibles:**\n- 400 si name en blanco, email inválido o password menor a 6 caracteres\n- 409 si el email ya está registrado"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 - Registrado correctamente",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register" },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Juan\",\n  \"email\": \"usuario@huly.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
                }
              },
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "text/plain" }],
              "body": "Usuario registrado correctamente"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 - Password muy corta",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register" },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Juan\",\n  \"email\": \"usuario@huly.com\",\n  \"password\": \"123\"\n}"
                }
              },
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"timestamp\": \"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\n  \"status\": 400,\n  \"error\": \"Bad Request\",\n  \"message\": \"Error de validación en los datos enviados\",\n  \"path\": \"/api/auth/register\",\n  \"errors\": {\n    \"password\": \"La contraseña debe tener al menos 6 caracteres\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "409 - Email ya registrado",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register" },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Juan\",\n  \"email\": \"usuario@huly.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
                }
              },
              "status": "Conflict",
              "code": 409,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"timestamp\": \"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\n  \"status\": 409,\n  \"error\": \"Conflict\",\n  \"message\": \"Email already in use\",\n  \"path\": \"/api/auth/register\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.accessToken);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@huly.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Autentica al usuario. Devuelve el access token en el body y guarda el refresh token en una cookie HTTP-only.\n\nEl script de test guarda el `accessToken` automáticamente en la variable de colección.\n\n**Respuesta exitosa:** 200 OK\n**Errores posibles:**\n- 401 si credenciales incorrectas o cuenta inactiva"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - Login exitoso (admin)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login" },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@huly.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                { "key": "Set-Cookie", "value": "refreshToken=<jwt>; Path=/; Max-Age=604800; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"accessToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...\",\n  \"role\": \"ADMIN\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 - Credenciales inválidas",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login" },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@huly.com\",\n  \"password\": \"wrongpass\"\n}"
                }
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"timestamp\": \"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\n  \"status\": 401,\n  \"error\": \"Unauthorized\",\n  \"message\": \"Invalid credentials\",\n  \"path\": \"/api/auth/login\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 - Cuenta inactiva",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login" },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"bloqueado@huly.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
                }
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"timestamp\": \"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\n  \"status\": 401,\n  \"error\": \"Unauthorized\",\n  \"message\": \"Account is not active\",\n  \"path\": \"/api/auth/login\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.accessToken);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Renueva el access token usando el refresh token de la cookie.\nRota el refresh token (emite uno nuevo en cookie, invalida el anterior).\n\nRequiere que Postman tenga habilitado 'Automatically follow redirects' y el manejo de cookies activo.\n\n**Respuesta exitosa:** 200 OK con nuevo accessToken en body y nuevo refreshToken en cookie\n**Errores posibles:**\n- 401 si la cookie no existe, el token expiró o ya fue usado"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - Token renovado",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh" }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                { "key": "Set-Cookie", "value": "refreshToken=<new_jwt>; Path=/; Max-Age=604800; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"accessToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 - Refresh token inválido o expirado",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh" }
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"timestamp\": \"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\n  \"status\": 401,\n  \"error\": \"Unauthorized\",\n  \"message\": \"Invalid or expired refresh token\",\n  \"path\": \"/api/auth/refresh\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 - Cookie no presente",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh" }
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"timestamp\": \"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\n  \"status\": 401,\n  \"error\": \"Unauthorized\",\n  \"message\": \"Refresh token not found\",\n  \"path\": \"/api/auth/refresh\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Cierra la sesión: invalida el refresh token en la base de datos y limpia la cookie.\n\n**Respuesta exitosa:** 204 No Content\n\nSi no hay cookie presente igual devuelve 204 (idempotente)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "204 - Logout exitoso",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout" }
              },
              "status": "No Content",
              "code": 204,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Set-Cookie", "value": "refreshToken=; Path=/; Max-Age=0; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax" }
              ],
              "body": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Examples",
      "description": "Endpoints de ejemplo para verificar el funcionamiento del servidor y el flujo básico de CRUD.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear ejemplo",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/examples",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "examples"]
            },
            "body": {
